00:50:39.000 --> 00:51:15.000
we decided not to identify him by his real name. Jane now lives in California and has been happily married for more than 40 years. She has kids and grandkids she dots on and she has a radio show about mythology. It's called questing and she's really passionate about it. She's become an entirely different person than the naive girl she was that weekend in college. I've turned out to be quite not forceful, but I stick up for myself. I stick up for my family and my friends
我们决定不使用他的真实姓名。简现在住在加利福尼亚州，已经幸福地结婚四十多年了。她有疼爱的孩子和孙辈，还有一个关于神话节目的广播节目。节目名字叫《寻觅》，她对它充满了热情。她已经完全变成了另一个人，不再是大学那个周末里天真无邪的女孩了。我变得……不能说是咄咄逼人，但我会为自己挺身而出。我会为我的家人和朋友挺身而出，

